/** \page InputFile Input File

This is navigator to find the input file tags

\section HowToWrite How to Write the Input File

The input file consists of key-value pairs where each key represents a specific setting.
Each parameter should be written in the following format:

\code
{
    parameter_name_1 = value_1,
    parameter_name_2 = value_2,
                :           
    parameter_name_N = value_N
}
\endcode

Lines beginning with `# or !` are considered comments and are ignored.

| Tag                   | Variable                                                     |
|-----------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------|
| method      			| \ref Config::method                 "method"                 | 
| quantity    			| \ref Config::quantity               "quantity"               | 
| order       			| \ref Config::order                  "order"                  | 
